WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.145
The Moon's orbit.

00:01.858 --> 00:09.921
The Moon goes round the Earth about 384 400 kilometres out, once in 27.3 days.

00:10.365 --> 00:13.270
Light crosses that gap in 1.3 seconds.

00:13.843 --> 00:17.856
Only a few people have gone further, swinging round the far side of the Moon.
